WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:23.960 --> 00:01:29.350
﻿Gije, piloting the Ideo-Nova, contacted Mebarul
﻿pretending he had became a traitor.

00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:37.860
﻿Cosmo trusted Gije and launched a pincer attack ﻿on Mebarul’s Heavy Mobile Mecha, destroying it.

00:01:38.510 --> 00:01:44.500
<b>When the Meteors Fall</b>

00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:12.310
Supreme Commander Doba 
himself is about to set off soon.

00:02:12.940 --> 00:02:18.020
﻿Yes... With the power of Ide, we can
 stop the meteors from harming us...

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:40.720
That's the Bairal Jin? ﻿I had no idea...

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:42.260
Where did they build that?

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:43.640
I heard there's even more to this...

00:02:46.260 --> 00:02:48.850
So that's the latest military news?

00:02:48.850 --> 00:02:49.350
﻿Yes sir.

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:53.770
﻿This is my chance to get promoted!

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:58.080
Imagine if I defeated the Giant before
﻿that huge fleet arrives! I'll become nobility!

00:02:58.440 --> 00:03:00.290
How long are you going to keep watching the news?

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:04.810
How is our pursuit of the Logo Dau ship proceeding?

00:03:04.810 --> 00:03:06.060
﻿Get to your posts!

00:03:06.060 --> 00:03:08.050
﻿It's alright! They're still under surveillance!

00:03:08.050 --> 00:03:08.700
﻿Pursue them!

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:09.780
﻿Yes sir!

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:26.390
﻿I wonder what's going on. ﻿The energy 
increases, then decreases again.

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:30.730
So the Ide Gauge hasn't acted like this before?

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:34.730
﻿Yeah, this only started happening
 after the recent power up.

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:36.400
﻿Is the power going up too much?

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:37.770
What do you mean, too much?

00:03:37.770 --> 00:03:41.730
﻿Lou...! Don’t pull any pranks, Lou!

00:03:42.490 --> 00:03:46.660
﻿Sheryl! Instead of looking after Lou,
 how about investigating the gauge?

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:47.870
﻿What’s happened?

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:49.940
﻿The Ideon Gauge has become unstable.

00:03:51.110 --> 00:03:51.910
﻿What could it be?

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:57.140
Can't we find a way to control it already?

00:03:57.140 --> 00:03:58.170
﻿Sorry.

00:03:58.170 --> 00:03:58.920
﻿Yeah!

00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:03.010
The Sixth Civilization built that
 because it's possible, right?

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:06.250
﻿It’s my responsibility, but I’m still not sure...

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:10.890
What if the Solo Ship and Ideon
 have become beyond us to control?

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:12.140
﻿Why?!

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:13.390
﻿What are you trying to say?

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:17.680
If the Ide can distinquish between good and evil...

00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:20.640
It means the Ide is capable of thought.

00:04:21.220 --> 00:04:22.740
﻿That seems logical...

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:24.870
Furthermore, those thoughts have an ego.

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:30.040
In other words, the Ide makes decisions
 it deems beneficial to itself.

00:04:30.740 --> 00:04:31.590
﻿That’s possible.

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:36.820
So... What is the hero of Ide from the Buff Clan legend?

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:42.790
Stories are just stories. Nobody
 has actually seen the hero...

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:48.380
Then why? Why did the Sixth
 Civilization build the Solo Ship?

00:04:48.380 --> 00:04:51.880
Why did the Sixth Civilization go extinct?

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:02.280
﻿DS Drive in two minutes!

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:04.420
All ships, get in DS Drive formation!

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:06.740
﻿Okay, enter DS Drive.

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:07.620
﻿Yes sir!

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:11.950
I swear on the name of Marshall
﻿ Franklin, we'll bring back the Solo Ship!

00:05:12.490 --> 00:05:13.980
﻿DS Drive! Start!

00:05:19.640 --> 00:05:25.000
Detecting gravitational vibrations! Distance sui 65, happa 32 degrees, no change!

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:31.120
If we get out of subspace here,
 we’ll be near Domou Star.

00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:36.110
﻿Aren’t we going to attack the Logo Dau aliens?

00:05:36.110 --> 00:05:36.890
﻿We’ll attack!

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:38.970
Using the Domou Star.

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:40.610
﻿Domou Star?

00:05:40.930 --> 00:05:44.000
How ignorant are you? You don’t know Domou Star?

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:47.450
It's only been investigated once, three years ago.

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:51.490
We'll have two Gita Zuro ships
 ambush them at Domou Star.

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:54.400
﻿The Gadmor Zan will ram itself at the enemy!

00:05:55.880 --> 00:05:56.610
Ram itself?

00:06:03.170 --> 00:06:04.300
﻿It’s the enemy!

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:05.290
Calculate their position!

00:06:05.710 --> 00:06:07.450
﻿Ideon, launch immediately!

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:11.920
﻿They’re at 7 o’clock, distance﻿ 3.6
 subspace units! Open the rear missiles!

00:06:20.200 --> 00:06:22.010
﻿They must be tracking our dimensional vibrations!

00:06:22.650 --> 00:06:24.040
Dimensional vibrations?

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:27.480
Are they following us by utilizing the Solo Ship's power?

00:06:28.570 --> 00:06:31.480
Just like that time with the﻿ Dorowa Zan and the Solo Ship.

00:06:36.850 --> 00:06:39.780
That's right, our power is being tracked. They’re tough!

00:06:50.780 --> 00:06:52.990
I’m sorry, did I wake you up?

00:06:52.990 --> 00:06:54.930
﻿An enemy attack?

00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:56.520
﻿It’s only a small squadron...

00:06:58.440 --> 00:06:59.930
﻿Hatari can't handle this alone.

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:04.000
﻿No... You still have a fever!

00:07:04.560 --> 00:07:05.780
﻿What do you want to know?

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:08.710
An enemy warship is following us.

00:07:10.050 --> 00:07:12.960
We can only DS Out and retreat. However...

00:07:14.320 --> 00:07:17.860
The enemy ship will pursue us
﻿to the very point where we DS Out.

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:21.710
We’ll think of something when the time comes.

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:22.510
﻿Yes.

00:07:27.140 --> 00:07:30.200
﻿Fire missiles! I don’t care what happens to this ship!

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:34.680
Can't you raise the barrier's power?

00:07:37.660 --> 00:07:38.890
﻿Hatari, DS Out!

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:42.700
﻿DS Drive Brake! All Ideon
 units, stay in a fixed position!

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:48.730
Don't let them get away! Cancel subspace flight!

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:49.140
Sir!

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:05.530
﻿A planet! Joliver, check its coordinates.

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:06.630
﻿On it.

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:08.130
﻿Bes said the enemy would follow...

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:10.540
﻿All Ideon units, standby in launch position!

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:15.840
﻿What now? The enemy is about to catch up!

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:17.540
﻿We’ll use this planet as a shield.

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:22.260
Let's enter the planet at a low altitude and
 take off once we get to the opposite side.

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:33.770
﻿We successfully lured them to Domou Star.
﻿Advance party, you better find them...

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:42.160
﻿Stay alert! I feel like we fell into a trap...

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:43.920
﻿No way!

00:08:43.920 --> 00:08:44.590
﻿I knew it!

00:08:52.870 --> 00:08:53.800
I told you!

00:08:58.630 --> 00:09:01.960
Incoming enemy formation!
 All hands, ﻿prepare for anti-air battle!

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:08.060
The enemy has taken the initiative.
 We need to quicken our pace!

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:09.220
﻿The gauge still isn't stable!

00:09:11.240 --> 00:09:13.400
﻿If this keeps going, it’ll be a one sided battle!

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:14.400
Are you ready?

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:14.990
﻿Roger!

00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:16.030
﻿Let’s go!

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:16.790
﻿Launching!

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:26.790
﻿A cave?

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:27.860
It's pitch black inside!

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:36.220
﻿A Domou?

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:37.220
﻿Domou?

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:42.710
We discovered this ﻿planet a few years ago.
 I heard about it in an exhibition once.

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:46.630
﻿Cover the Solo Ship!

00:09:50.960 --> 00:09:53.810
﻿Now I know why they lured us into this planet.

00:09:53.810 --> 00:09:55.560
﻿Gije! What should we do?

00:09:55.560 --> 00:09:59.730
Enemies in the air, Domou on
the ground... We're trapped like rats.

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:05.870
Get behind the Domou!

00:10:26.310 --> 00:10:27.810
﻿I can’t move!

00:10:27.810 --> 00:10:29.010
﻿Can’t we dock?!

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:31.150
﻿We can’t, the power is too unstable!

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:34.220
﻿Kasha, we’ll cover you!
 Watch your timing and escape!

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:55.540
﻿Gije, this is all going as the enemy
 planned. What should we do?

00:10:56.340 --> 00:11:00.160
Every predicament is an opportunity.
 I'll head out first, follow me!

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:05.360
﻿Is Gije going to act as bait? Kasha, let's go!

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:21.030
﻿Fire missiles and beams in front
 of us to create an escape route!

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:21.910
﻿You can’t do that!

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:22.570
﻿Why not?

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:24.450
﻿The Domou are supposed to be docile creatures!

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:25.020
﻿Yeah, but...

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:28.410
﻿Also, they are giving us cover.

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:29.450
﻿Karala...

00:11:29.450 --> 00:11:31.250
﻿Bes! You should be sleeping!

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:33.000
﻿What's happening?

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:33.990
We're about to escape!

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:36.880
Is that really true, Karala?

00:11:36.880 --> 00:11:37.990
That's right.

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:45.360
And if we want the Ide on our side, shouldn't
 we avoid killing innocent animals, Sheryl?

00:11:46.130 --> 00:11:50.080
Right, if the Ide really has an ego...

00:11:50.650 --> 00:11:51.450
﻿Bes!

00:11:53.680 --> 00:11:55.000
﻿Bes...

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:55.650
﻿Bes!

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:15.080
﻿Gije, what's wrong? Did you get hit?

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:16.960
There's no time to fight them one by one!

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:19.710
Let's lead them below the Domou
 and destroy them all at once!

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:38.060
Oh no! We're surrounded!

00:12:38.060 --> 00:12:41.200
﻿Gije, go straight ahead!
 Hide beneath the waterfall!

00:12:41.200 --> 00:12:42.230
Waterfall?

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:45.650
﻿We too...

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:46.860
Bes!

00:12:46.860 --> 00:12:47.980
﻿We too...

00:12:49.280 --> 00:12:51.730
In order to defend ourselves...

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:57.780
﻿We have the right to think
 and make our own decisions...

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:07.970
I am the accumulation of
thousands, tens of thousands,

00:13:08.090 --> 00:13:12.070
﻿hundreds of millions of consciousnesses...

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:16.080
I will defend my existence as well.

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:17.230
Defend...

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:18.730
Defend...

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:23.150
People are the source of wisdom and conscience!

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:28.410
Does the Ide exist to kill people?

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:37.670
I have the right to defend the rightful
 habitat of the spirit, the place of Ide.

00:13:46.520 --> 00:13:50.170
﻿Why do you allow people to keep fighting each other?

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:53.180
﻿I ask this...

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:55.550
﻿Why do you hate each other?

00:13:57.020 --> 00:13:59.220
We don't hate each other...

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:04.480
Why are you not wise enough to see the outcome?

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:09.450
﻿Outcome? Are you making this happen, testing us?

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:13.540
﻿We do not possess such power...

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:17.660
We are but ourselves, a single being.

00:14:19.210 --> 00:14:21.890
If we both are suffering...

00:14:23.620 --> 00:14:27.030
We ought to use all of our
strength to find the righteous path.

00:14:27.340 --> 00:14:29.540
A power such as that...

00:14:30.360 --> 00:14:36.200
Demonstrate your true strength! 
The power of the will should cross even dimensions!

00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:45.360
﻿I am not a part of you!

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:49.240
﻿I am me... I am my own self!

00:14:55.490 --> 00:14:56.450
Bes...

00:14:56.450 --> 00:14:57.620
﻿Bes!

00:14:57.620 --> 00:14:58.780
﻿Hang on, Bes!

00:15:01.220 --> 00:15:02.210
﻿How is he?

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:04.840
﻿Has his fever gone down yet?

00:15:04.840 --> 00:15:06.920
﻿No, seems like he's having a nightmare...

00:15:10.430 --> 00:15:11.220
﻿Bes!

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:15.750
﻿Karala... I saw a terrifying dream.

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:17.000
﻿A dream?

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:18.060
﻿The Ide...

00:15:18.720 --> 00:15:19.480
﻿The Ide...

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:20.480
Ide?

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:24.840
﻿The Ide... ﻿Wants to keep on living.

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:26.390
Keep on living?

00:15:26.660 --> 00:15:27.750
﻿Ide!

00:15:28.590 --> 00:15:30.820
﻿Lou! Lou, you spoke?!

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:31.520
﻿Lou?

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:33.060
﻿Ide!

00:15:39.110 --> 00:15:42.170
We can't locate the ship or the three Giant units!

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:44.490
Find them! Look for the
 point where they disappeared!

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:49.790
They can't have buried themselves underground!

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:03.590
What is this cave?

00:16:03.590 --> 00:16:04.980
﻿The temperature is severe.

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:06.110
﻿What should we do?

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:09.390
We aren't being chased, so it
 seems that we shook them off.

00:16:11.360 --> 00:16:14.680
Huh, what is that thing?

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:20.360
It's cracking open like an egg!

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:24.780
﻿All units, ascend!

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:32.950
That has to be an egg! The egg
 of those Domou creatures!

00:16:33.140 --> 00:16:34.180
An egg?

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:37.880
They're so big, I didn't notice. They're clearly eggs!

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:42.430
﻿So we ran into the hatching
ground of the Domou eggs...

00:16:42.430 --> 00:16:44.480
We ended up in a pretty troublesome place.

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:45.180
Why's that?

00:16:45.320 --> 00:16:49.600
That's right. Do you think the Ide is testing us-

00:16:48.730 --> 00:16:49.600
﻿In front!

00:16:56.910 --> 00:16:58.340
﻿They’ve found us!

00:16:58.340 --> 00:17:00.960
﻿Let’s get out! We can’t fight here!

00:17:01.400 --> 00:17:02.280
Ready?

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:04.500
﻿Roger!

00:17:08.830 --> 00:17:09.630
Charge!

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:33.890
﻿No! We can’t leave this cave!

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:54.740
﻿What?

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:56.930
﻿The Ideon Gauge!

00:18:02.600 --> 00:18:04.420
Don't start docking on your own!

00:18:11.270 --> 00:18:14.100
Did the Ideon move out of its own will?

00:18:20.110 --> 00:18:22.640
What? It can withstand all this fire?

00:18:27.270 --> 00:18:30.130
﻿Push it off! Push the Giant off of us!

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:11.710
﻿We did it?

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:13.290
﻿We did it...

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:14.380
﻿No way...

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:16.620
﻿Yeah.

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:27.420
﻿Reinforcements?

00:19:27.620 --> 00:19:29.140
What now, Cosmo?!

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:33.300
﻿We can’t damage this planet any
 further, we're leaving! Alright, Gije?

00:19:33.300 --> 00:19:34.090
Agreed!

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:48.900
﻿Those ships aren't our reinforcements!

00:19:49.380 --> 00:19:50.360
﻿What?!

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:53.620
Could they be the Logo Dau aliens' allies?

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:55.360
They're sending a signal.

00:19:55.670 --> 00:19:56.700
﻿Alright.

00:19:57.210 --> 00:20:02.360
Since we must defeat the Giant before
 Supreme Commander Doba arrives...

00:20:03.970 --> 00:20:05.140
﻿A red flag!

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:06.850
﻿No, a white flag?

00:20:06.850 --> 00:20:08.470
﻿Raise it! I'll meet with their commander.

00:20:15.100 --> 00:20:18.530
We hold just as much battle strength as you,
 yet we were destroyed in an instant!

00:20:18.560 --> 00:20:23.140
This all started because your
 allies went and activated that Giant!

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:27.030
We know that the Ide accumulates intelligence,

00:20:27.030 --> 00:20:29.790
and has the ability to turn it into energy.

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:33.650
But I've heard the Ide also
 has the power to protect itself.

00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:40.100
﻿Did you know that meteors have been
 falling on the Buff Clan Earth for two years?

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:43.890
﻿Meteors?

00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:45.300
So you know?

00:20:47.320 --> 00:20:51.970
﻿The Earth has been hit by meteors for two years too...

00:20:51.970 --> 00:20:53.620
﻿It can’t be...

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:58.720
﻿What if the power of Ide is causing that?

00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:02.230
That's utter nonsense...

00:21:02.640 --> 00:21:06.940
﻿No, such power couldn’t exist. Not in this world!

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:08.450
Oh man...

00:21:10.530 --> 00:21:12.700
It was a Scarabelli-class ship.

00:21:12.700 --> 00:21:16.680
﻿It looks like we’ve made enemies
﻿of every person in the universe...

00:21:18.460 --> 00:21:21.300
﻿But if the Ide was controlling the Ideon...

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:24.300
﻿The Ide has taken our side.

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:25.880
﻿That’s right.

00:21:25.880 --> 00:21:29.760
If the Ide is only activated by
 a pure self-defense instinct...

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:33.650
It's better to think that it was
 defending the Domou eggs.

00:21:33.650 --> 00:21:37.810
Our attempt to rescue the eggs might be unrelated.

00:21:37.810 --> 00:21:40.230
﻿I think it was the both of them.

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:43.600
I agree with Cosmo's line of thought.

00:21:43.880 --> 00:21:45.090
﻿Bes!

00:21:46.360 --> 00:21:49.440
﻿The Ide is energy created by the
accumulation of knowledge.

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:51.140
And?

00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:55.400
Are you saying that the Ide reflects
the thoughts of us living beings?

00:21:55.400 --> 00:22:00.630
﻿Yes, good minds and evil minds,
each in their own way.

00:22:00.630 --> 00:22:03.370
But there's still one big problem.

00:22:03.370 --> 00:22:07.760
That can't be! We're only trying to survive!

00:22:07.840 --> 00:22:10.320
﻿No, it’s not that, but....

00:22:11.850 --> 00:22:18.130
It's the fact that we hold this immeasurable
﻿power, yet we don’t know how to control it...

00:22:30.570 --> 00:22:36.580
﻿It seemed as if the Solo Ship was
﻿producing the meteors.

00:22:36.900 --> 00:22:39.830
Yet in reality, the Solo Ship-

00:22:50.050 --> 00:22:54.430
<i>﻿The Buff Clan and Earth Union Military
﻿together pursue the Solo Ship.</i>

00:22:55.220 --> 00:23:00.350
<i>﻿Their strategy to destroy a satellite and drive the
 Solo Ship into asteroids seemingly succeeds.</i>

00:23:01.560 --> 00:23:05.270
<i>﻿But the Ideon rises with a flash of light.</i>

00:23:06.070 --> 00:23:08.780
<i>Is it the power of a devil?</i>

00:23:09.950 --> 00:23:12.440
<i>﻿Next time on Legendary Giant Ideon,</i>

